      "seed": 1016502294,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1411699530,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793336890387,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Desktop app (main process)\n - Clerk sign-in: PKCE, then refresh\n - relay/hosts via plxd A on sign-in, focus,\n   network back, and Settings (no timer)\n - One account:<hostId> connection per host\n - Routes: learned LAN first, then relay\n - Re-checks LAN every 60 s and on network change,\n   moves back when it answers",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "app",
      "originalText": " Desktop app (main process)\n - Clerk sign-in: PKCE, then refresh\n - relay/hosts via plxd A on sign-in, focus,\n   network back, and Settings (no timer)\n - One account:<hostId> connection per host\n - Routes: learned LAN first, then relay\n - Re-checks LAN every 60 s and on network change,\n   moves back when it answers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
